an begin="00:14.498" end="00:15.170">心地</span><span begin="00:15.170" end="00:15.510">が</span><span begin="00:15.510" end="00:15.777">し</span><span begin="00:15.777" end="00:16.364">た</span><span begin="00:16.364" end="00:16.638">の</span><span begin="00:16.638" end="00:17.083">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">感受到的那阵</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o 'k ko chi te ku yo u na</span></p><p begin="00:18.094" end="00:21.017" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:18.094" end="00:19.062">目と目が</span><span begin="00:19.143" end="00:19.775">合った</span><span begin="00:19.775" end="00:20.199">時</span><span begin="00:20.199" end="00:20.615">でし</span><span begin="00:20.615" end="00:21.017">た</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko chi ga shi ta no wa</span></p><p begin="00:21.027" end="00:23.313" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:21.027" end="00:21.507">ほんの</span><span begin="00:21.507" end="00:21.934">一</span><span begin="00:21.934" end="00:22.574">瞬</span><span begin="00:22.574" end="00:22.811">の</span><span begin="00:22.811" end="00:23.313">こと</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只在你我视线</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">me to me ga a 't ta to ki de shi ta</span></p><p begin="00:23.886" end="00:26.803" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:23.886" end="00:24.180">きっ</span><span begin="00:24.180" end="00:24.590">と</span><span begin="00:24.590" end="00:25.002">困</span><span begin="00:25.002" end="00:25.355">らせ</span><span begin="00:25.355" end="00:25.991">ちゃう</span><span begin="00:25.991" end="00:26.193">で</span><span begin="00:26.193" end="00:26.803">しょ？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">交汇的一瞬</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho n no i 's shu n no ko to</span></p><p begin="00:27.259" end="00:29.931" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:27.259" end="00:27.862">全部</span><span begin="00:27.862" end="00:28.219">伝</span><span begin="00:28.219" end="00:28.471">えて</span><span begin="00:28.471" end="00:28.670">し</span><span begin="00:28.670" end="00:29.195">ま</span><span begin="00:29.195" end="00:29.440">え</span><span begin="00:29.440" end="00:29.931">ば</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki 't to ko ma ra se cha u de sho ？</span></p><p begin="00:30.945" end="00:33.810" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:30.945" end="00:31.404">崩</span><span begin="00:31.404" end="00:32.199">れていく</span><span begin="00:32.199" end="00:32.593">もの</span><span begin="00:32.593" end="00:32.758">ば</span><span begin="00:32.758" end="00:33.201">か</span><span begin="00:33.201" end="00:33.383">り</span><span begin="00:33.383" end="00:33.810">が</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ze n bu tsu ta e te shi ma e ba</span></p><p begin="00:33.820" end="00:36.132" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:33.820" end="00:34.329">頭</span><span begin="00:34.329" end="00:34.596">を</span><span begin="00:34.596" end="00:35.161">めぐる</span><span begin="00:35.161" end="00:35.656">め</span><span begin="00:35.656" end="00:36.132">ぐる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">唯有崩溃 缓缓地</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ku zu re te i ku mo no ba ka ri ga</span></p><p begin="00:36.931" end="00:43.651" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="00:36.931" end="00:37.392">君</span><span begin="00:37.392" end="00:37.584">が</span><span begin="00:37.584" end="00:38.385">愛</span><span begin="00:38.385" end="00:38.906">お</span><span begin="00:38.906" end="00:39.516">しく</span><span begin="00:39.516" end="00:40.078">思</span><span begin="00:40.078" end="00:40.614">うのは</span><span begin="00:40.614" end="00:41.481">私</span><span begin="00:41.481" end="00:42.081">じゃ</span><span begin="00:42.227" end="00:42.793">ない</span><span begin="00:42.793" end="00:43.651">かもと</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在我脑海中来回打转</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ta ma wo me gu ru me gu ru</span></p><p begin="00:43.761" end="00:47.239" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="00:43.761" end="00:43.934">ど</span><span begin="00:43.934" end="00:44.213">こ</span><span begin="00:44.213" end="00:44.761">かで</span><span begin="00:44.761" end="00:45.287">ずっと</span><span begin="00:45.359" end="00:45.828">感</span><span begin="00:45.828" end="00:46.201">じ</span><span begin="00:46.201" end="00:46.789">ているの</span><span begin="00:46.789" end="00:47.239">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">并不是我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi ja na i ka mo to</span></p><p begin="00:49.717" end="00:55.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="00:49.717" end="00:50.371">のぼせ</span><span begin="00:50.371" end="00:51.022">た</span><span begin="00:51.022" end="00:51.801">頬</span><span begin="00:51.801" end="00:52.035">を</span><span begin="00:52.035" end="00:53.014">夜風</span><span begin="00:53.014" end="00:53.342">に</span><span begin="00:53.465" end="00:54.250">任</span><span begin="00:54.250" end="00:54.488">せ</span><span begin="00:54.488" end="00:55.000">て</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">no bo se ta ho ho wo yo ka ze ni ma ka se te</span></p><p begin="00:55.010" end="00:56.746" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="00:55.010" end="00:55.154">冷</span><span begin="00:55.154" end="00:55.453">や</span><span begin="00:55.453" end="00:55.769">し</span><span begin="00:55.769" end="00:56.746">て</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi ya shi te</span></p><p begin="00:58.896" end="01:02.062" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="00:58.896" end="00:59.484">煌</span><span begin="00:59.484" end="00:59.942">めい</span><span begin="00:59.942" end="01:00.422">て</span><span begin="01:00.575" end="01:01.553">消えてっ</span><span begin="01:01.553" end="01:02.062">た</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi ya shi te</span></p><p begin="01:02.172" end="01:05.786" t